      "video2": "In Order to have the right mindset when developing a game, you have to be able to find creative ideas, have the perseverance to make the game, be able to adapt to making new games for the industry, be able to collab with other game developers, and being able to appeal to your customers with your games. One must have something to a growth mindset in order to create games, that way yo are able to not feel like you're forcefully making games without any sense of enjoyment. The video also talks about how to deal with obstacles.",
